# payload_drop: release the payload with two PWM commands on one servo output (MAV_CMD_DO_SET_SERVO, in
# GUIDED, no mode change): open_pwm, wait `interval` s, close_pwm. Zero / negative fields = node parameters.
uint8 channel                 # SERVOn output (Cube Orange: 9 = AUX1)
uint16 open_pwm               # us, releases the payload
uint16 close_pwm              # us, back to the closed / reset position
float32 interval              # s between the two commands
---
bool success
string message
uint16 payloads_delivered
---
string state
